ab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116772},{"name":"jSith/GroupBot","owner":"jSith","html_url":"https://github.com/jSith/GroupBot","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":5,"language":"Python","description":"Groupme Bots","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116773},{"name":"rgreen1207/flask-interview-task","owner":"rgreen1207","html_url":"https://github.com/rgreen1207/flask-interview-task","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116781},{"name":"Squiege/PythonRegex","owner":"Squiege","html_url":"https://github.com/Squiege/PythonRegex","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python Regex","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116797},{"name":"FATE4869/lyapunov-hyperopt-master","owner":"FATE4869","html_url":"https://github.com/FATE4869/lyapunov-hyperopt-master","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116803},{"name":"Honorinenn/mlflow","owner":"Honorinenn","html_url":"https://github.com/Honorinenn/mlflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116804},{"name":"TheHeidal/SAP-Hackathon-Python","owner":"TheHeidal","html_url":"https://github.com/TheHeidal/SAP-Hackathon-Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"we're doing it in python, people","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":116806},{"name":"dleen/nbdev_test_101","owner":"dleen","h